docs[2]{path,scope}:
  CHANGELOG.md,project
  docs/stable-check-evidence.md,project
body: "Root cause is in release-tag window discovery. The CLI sets includeOrphaned, which omits git tag --merged HEAD. That correctly keeps rebase-orphaned tags, but it also admits descendant tags. The newest descendant becomes the leading window and claims work closed after the previous reachable tag."
